<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Contract Expiring</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: {{#if isCritical}}#dc2626{{else if isUrgent}}#f59e0b{{else}}#2563eb{{/if}}; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f9fafb; }
        .contract-details { background: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0; }
        .renew-btn { display: inline-block; background: #059669; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>{{#if isCritical}}🚨{{else if isUrgent}}⚠️{{else}}📋{{/if}} Contract Expiring</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{tenantName}},</p>
            <p>Your lease contract is expiring soon. Please review the details and take appropriate action:</p>
            
            <div class="contract-details">
                <h3>Contract Information</h3>
                <p><strong>Contract Number:</strong> {{contractNumber}}</p>
                <p><strong>End Date:</strong> {{endDate}}</p>
                <p><strong>Days Remaining:</strong> {{daysLeft}}</p>
            </div>
            
            {{#if isCritical}}
                <p><strong>URGENT:</strong> Your contract expires in less than a week! Immediate action is required to avoid service disruption.</p>
            {{else if isUrgent}}
                <p><strong>ATTENTION:</strong> Your contract expires within 30 days. Please renew soon to ensure continuity of service.</p>
            {{else}}
                <p>Your contract is expiring soon. We recommend starting the renewal process to avoid any interruptions.</p>
            {{/if}}
            
            <a href="{{renewUrl}}" class="renew-btn">Renew Contract Now</a>
            
            <p>If you have any questions about the renewal process or need to discuss your options, please contact our contract management team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
